        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Generate a recipe based on the user's input: {{ $json.recipe }}\n\nIf the user's input is empty, null, or missing, do not invent a recipe.\nSet is_dish to false, leave all recipe fields empty, and set message to:\n\"I couldn't identify a recipe request. Please enter a dish name or cooking question.\"\n\nReturn the result as valid JSON only, using exactly these fields:\n- `is_dish`: boolean\n- `dish_name`: string\n- `preparation_time`: string\n- `cooking_time`: string\n- `ingredients`: array of strings\n- `instructions`: array of strings\n- `cooking_tips`: array of strings\n- `message`: string\n\nIf the input is a dish or recipe request, set `is_dish` to true and provide the recipe details.\n\nIf the input is not a dish or recipe request, set `is_dish` to false, leave the recipe fields as empty strings or empty arrays, and put a brief helpful response in `message`.\n\nDo not include Markdown code fences or any text outside the JSON."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "recipe_response",
              "schema": "\n{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"is_dish\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"dish_name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"preparation_time\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"cooking_time\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"ingredients\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"instructions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"cooking_tips\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"message\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"is_dish\",\n    \"dish_name\",\n    \"preparation_time\",\n    \"cooking_time\",\n    \"ingredients\",\n    \"instructions\",\n    \"cooking_tips\",\n    \"message\"\n  ]\n}\n"
            }
          }
